Patterns translated into valvur's own Checks
--------------------------------------------

mcp-scanner
    https://github.com/cisco-ai-defense/mcp-scanner
    Apache License 2.0
    Copyright 2025 Cisco Systems, Inc. and its affiliates; 41 regular
    expressions from the YARA rules prompt_injection, coercive_injection,
    data_exfiltration and credential_harvesting, at commit
    9e47aabdf2017b82e78f3419f39a75f20b6f98fa, translated into the AI Artifact
    Check (`src/valvur/checks/borrowed.py`, D14). Each Finding they produce
    names the pattern in its title.

