Data
----

CISA Known Exploited Vulnerabilities catalog
    https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog
    A work of the United States Government, in the public domain; a snapshot is
    bundled in the image (ADR-0007).

FIRST EPSS
    https://www.first.org/epss
    The daily scores file, fetched into the host cache by `valvur update` and by
    a scan when it is two days old, on every profile; never bundled (R11.4).

OpenSSF Malicious Packages
    https://github.com/ossf/malicious-packages
    Apache License 2.0
    Copyright the OpenSSF Malicious Packages contributors. Its records are
    reduced, daily, to the known-malicious list published beside the package-name
    index (`ghcr.io/maverickhq/valvur-index:malicious`, D26); ten of them, as
    published, are test fixtures under `tests/fixtures/malicious-packages`.
